ket_one_rulings_2026_09_11.md)** — bridge=Road B · fetch=Socket B · shared bag=REALM CRDT · PRF never mints\n- **[THE OPERATOR'S MIND ORIGINATES](project_operator_mind_originates.md)** — disk and CRDT CO-PROJECT; **neither is canon**. Divergence SURFACES as conflict, never a fault to refuse\n- **[HOSTFUL NAMES CONTENT](project_hostful_names_content_not_residency.md)** — any `lar:` URI is a valid meme title, NOT residency; **`canon-boundary.mem:70-72` detects NOTHING**\n- **[WIKIS-FIRST WRITES](project_projection_is_a_deliberate_act.md)** — **AI writes land on `wikis/<slug>/working`; `bags/` only by RESIDENCY MOVE**\n- **[AHU-FAMILY QUOTEBLOCK FLOOR](project_ahu_family_quoteblock_floor.md)** — un-decomposable content FENCES; TWO grains (whole chunk on ingest · ahu body on in-place update); the fence IS the surfaced artifact. RULED, UNBUILT\n- **[NEXUS GRADIENT](project_nexus_gradient_stand_then_connect.md)** — boards key on the NEXUS; **the gradient ratchets on INTENT, not accident**\n- **[NEXUS DIAL SEAM](project_nexus_dial_seam.md)** — **CLOSED**: admit pin carries url AND gate key\n- **[`bag`=USER SPACE · `meme` VERBS](project_bag_is_user_space_and_meme_verbs.md)** — residency rides the ENVELOPE; a stamped field MOVES THE HASH\n- **[FIELD COLLISION](../../../../Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/field-collision.mem)** — SPKI/SDSI+KERI vindicate it; OWED: watchers · bounded φ-silence\n- **[COLLAPSE SURVEY](project_collapse_survey_2026_09_12.md)** — **FIVE things that look collapsible but must NOT fuse**\n- **[GROUNDS BEFORE WINS](feedback_grounds_before_wins.md)** — rank by WHAT-INHERITS-SHAPE: canon → substrate → KEL → face → humans\n- **[CARRIER-HEAD SHORE](project_carrier_head_shore.md)** — ALL sigil values QUOTE (a bare positional binds a PHANTOM param)\n- **[THE REGISTRY FILTER](project_registry_filter_law.md)** — a compiled-about registry at ANY scope → REJECT the fork\n- **[RECOVERY LAYERED](project_recovery_ruling_layered.md)** — B-for-the-NAME · self-A-for-MEMORY · C-for-end-users\n- **[ALPHA LINE: NO BACK-COMPAT](project_alpha_line_no_back_compass.md)** — collapse crud freely, TEST-FIRST\n- **[VEIL RULING](project_veil_ruling_stage0.md)** — veil derives from the DEVICE-MINTED vessel key, NEVER the seed\n- **[SHIFT HANDOFF](../../../../Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/handoff.mem)** — READ BEFORE GRAMMAR WORK\n- [FACE-JOIN + PLANE LAW](project_face_join_and_plane_law.md) — **READ BEFORE ADMIT/JOIN/PLANE.** standing ⊥ capability · @daemon NEVER crosses · seat ≠ key\n- **[SEALED-ARCHIVE WRITE HOLES](project_sealed_archive_write_holes.md)** — **READ BEFORE ANY SEALED-CARRIER WRITE.** a mistyped passphrase DESTROYED the identity archive; `key-wrong` SEALS, so no cleartext test catches it\n- [CRYPTO SPINE](project_crypto_spine_and_safety_ledger.md) — **READ BEFORE CRYPTO REFACTOR.** @cad seal DETERMINISTIC, sealed-box RANDOM\n- [SESSION ARC](project_session_arc_2026_07_11_to_08_01.md) — **READ AT COLD BOOT.** a hand enumeration cannot notice what it missed (9×)\n- [BROWSER KEY CUSTODY](project_browser_key_custody.md) — **READ BEFORE BROWSER IDENTITY.** raw seed CLEARTEXT ON DISK\n- [ATTESTATION SEAT](project_attestation_seat_research.md) — **READ BEFORE TLD/GOVERNANCE.** no ROSTER — a roster IS a global now\n- [ONE NAME, ONE RELATION](project_one_name_one_relation.md) — **READ BEFORE NAMING.** HOLDING · MEETING · BEING\n- [FACE PLANES](project_persona_scoped_face_planes.md) — **READ BEFORE @circles/@identities.** a vessel-global @circles CORRELATES\n- [PERSONA PLANES](project_persona_plane_naming.md) — **READ BEFORE PERSONA/VESSEL-BOOT.** Deixis resolves ONCE at boot\n- [YIN LOOP 3](project_yin_loop3_sprawl.md) — **READ BEFORE VESSEL REFACTOR.** composeLararium/composeBrowser = ONE FUNCTION\n- [CAPTURE era3](project_capture_era3_unretired.md) — **READ BEFORE CAPTURE/RECALL.** TS engine retired-but-undeleted\n- [PREFOUNDING CHURN](project_prefounding_churn_ruling.md) · [IaM PAP