ut of the .vsix with package-contents' first collider · overreach-cut after degraded-ground runs in CI · backlogs after the cause field and the one-cause ratchet · four fixtures after their snapshot samples exist.\n6. L-Prime/Evergreen, once, with the three questions in D, never inside the verbatim handback.\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfoCYWGasxZuTPrCE5G4Y","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b77e10c-e27b-46a0-bcfb-6e3e679f26df","timestamp":"2026-10-07T16:37:41.581Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/VSCode-TW5-Syntax","sessionId":"7bdba225-5131-4cfb-a258-6d3e7da875f9","version":"2.1.277","gitBranch":"release/3.0.0","slug":"luminous-strolling-torvalds"}
