./bags/lararium/ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/projection-nalu.mem:136:`mesh/projection-nalu.ts` stands the single door to the nalus: the family vocabulary plus three engines — ''`CoalesceGate`'' (single source, window-from-first-mark, extracted from the DOM nalu), ''`KeyedCoalesceGate`'' (per-key, debounce-trailing; carries the `maxWaitMs` auditTime progress-guarantee (#/guards) and an OPT-IN window-`servo` (#/servo) — both inert until configured) and ''`KeyedReconcileGate`'' (per-key, level-triggered, timer-free: one drain reconciles keys one at a time in first-marked order and yields to the host between them). The accumulate sibling `CaptureNalu` (`capture-nalu.ts`) sits beside them, referenced not merged. WITNESSED: `CoalesceGate` · `KeyedCoalesceGate` · `KeyedReconcileGate` · the `GateFamily`/`ProjectionGate` marker discriminant (all in `projection-nalu.ts`) — a tag, no base class, the engines stay distinct.
